        "content": "<div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f1923,#1a2332);padding:16px 24px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #ff8800'><div style='color:#ff8800;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold'>\u26a1 Cross-Domain Impact Analysis</div><div style='color:#aaa;margin-top:6px;font-size:13px'>How a poorly written job cascades: Job resource abuse \u2192 NCCL socket storm \u2192 Network congestion \u2192 GPU unavailability \u2192 Capacity loss</div><div style='display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:10px;font-size:11px'><span style='color:#7ee787'>\u25cf Healthy state</span><span style='color:#f0c040'>\u25cf Warning threshold</span><span style='color:#ff7b72'>\u25cf Critical / cascading failure</span></div></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1
    },
    {
